[32.066, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ I've written the plan and saved it to `/cfg/plans/make-a-plan-for-jaunty-wren.md`. The working name is\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  SpokeQuest, which is only a placeholder. I haven't started any code. The working directory was empty, so I\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  didn't explore anything first.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **MVP:**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Auth, a bike garage, and GPS ride recording that keeps working in the background.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - A ride summary with a map and the XP earned.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Gamification through XP, levels, weekly streaks, badges and weekly quests.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Social features: a feed, kudos, clubs and leaderboards.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Stack:** Expo with TypeScript and Expo Router, Zustand and TanStack Query for state, Mapbox for maps,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  and a SQLite buffer so a crash doesn't lose a ride. Supabase (Postgres with PostGIS) is the backend.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  Background location needs EAS dev builds, so Expo Go won't be enough.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Anti-cheat and privacy:** XP is calculated on the server, with checks for car rides and GPS jumps.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  Privacy zones hide the start and end of rides near home.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Timeline:** about 12 weeks from setup to store submission, split into phases.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **After the MVP:** Bluetooth sensors, a territory-capture mechanic, segments, Strava and Garmin imports,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  and a premium tier.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  The plan also covers the data model, risks and how to test it end to end.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  The plan ends with four questions that would change it:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - Is this a solo build or a team?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - How will it make money?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - Which map provider, and what budget?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - What launch region, and iOS first or both platforms?\u001b[0m\r\n"]
