[103.754, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ The restatement is settled, and I copied the plan as it stands to `.ambition/steps/2/`. I haven't changed\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  the plan itself in this step.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Did:** I asked the four altitude questions and restated the task as a blueprint your team can build\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  from. It has ordered tickets with acceptance criteria and settled stack choices with rough costs. It also\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  has a tight v1 cut with a reason for each deferral.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Found:** Ride recording is the riskiest piece, and I can only test it on your phones. The pricing and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  dependency checks I can run myself.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Changed course:** Following your note, I'll keep the spike minimal. It will be a small app in\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  `<workspace>/spike-gps/` that logs background GPS points and gaps. If you can't run it on your phones soon,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  the plan will mark recording reliability as unverified.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  Next is the depth step.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
